# SDD scratch workspace (ledger, briefs, review packages)
.superpowers/

# Probe files. NOTHING WRITES THESE INTO THIS TREE ANY MORE, as of 2026-09-13:
# tests/architecture/boundary.test.ts copies src/ into a temp root outside the
# repo and writes its probes there, and asserts that none of the four paths
# exists here afterward. The reason is in that file's `cruiseWithProbes`
# comment, with the measured race it closes.
#
# Kept as a backstop rather than deleted, because the hazard it guards is cheap
# to guard and expensive to hit: a stray `node:fs` or `three` import inside the
# one tree that must stay browser-loadable, committed by accident. `__name__.ts`
# is this repo's probe convention and nothing else uses it. The same test
# asserts each path is ignored, so a fifth probe path added without a matching
# rule fails the suite instead of rotting this comment.
src/**/__*__.ts

# Harness-managed worktrees
.claude/worktrees/
